his symbol carries the empty rhyme ㄭ, which is never written. After ㄓ ㄔ ㄕ ㄖ it is [ɻ̩]: hold the ㄖ position and voice it. Error: saying \"ee\" (reading pinyin shi as \"she\") or adding a schwa.","examples":[{"zh":"老師","zhuyin":"ㄌㄠˇ ㄕ","en":"teacher","id":"179200095","level":"第1級"},{"zh":"是","zhuyin":"ㄕˋ","en":"to be; yes","id":"4934","level":"第1級"},{"zh":"手機","zhuyin":"ㄕㄡˇ ㄐㄧ","en":"mobile phone","id":null,"level":"第1級"},{"zh":"時候","zhuyin":"ㄕˊ ㄏㄡˋ","en":"time; moment","id":"490400010","level":"第1級"}],"audio":"juyin:ㄕ"},{"symbol":"ㄖ","ipa":"ʐ ~ ɻ","how":"The ㄕ position plus voice, with little friction and no lip rounding.","error":"English rounded r [ɹʷ].","notes":"Written with no final, this symbol carries the empty rhyme ㄭ, which is never written. After ㄓ ㄔ ㄕ ㄖ it is [ɻ̩]: hold the ㄖ position and voice it. Error: saying \"ee\" (reading pinyin shi as \"she\") or adding a schwa.","examples":[{"zh":"日本","zhuyin":"ㄖˋ ㄅㄣˇ","en":"Japan","id":null},{"zh":"認識","zhuyin":"ㄖㄣˋ ˙ㄕ","en":"to know (a person)","id":null,"level":"第2級"},{"zh":"熱","zhuyin":"ㄖㄜˋ","en":"hot","id":"5184","level":"第1級"},{"zh":"人","zhuyin":"ㄖㄣˊ","en":"person","id":"5201","level":"第1級"}],"audio":"juyin:ㄖ"},{"symbol":"ㄗ","ipa":"ts","how":"\"ts\" as in \"cats\", voiceless.","error":"Voicing ㄗ into English z.","notes":"Written with no final, this symbol carries the empty rhyme ㄭ, which is never written. After ㄗ ㄘ ㄙ it is [ɹ̩ ~ z̩]: buzz in the ㄙ position. Error: saying \"ee\" or adding a schwa.","examples":[{"zh":"再見","zhuyin":"ㄗㄞˋ ㄐㄧㄢˋ","en":"goodbye","id":"532400008","level":"第1級"},{"zh":"字","zhuyin":"ㄗˋ","en":"character; word","id":"5299","level":"第1級"},{"zh":"昨天","zhuyin":"ㄗㄨㄛˊ ㄊㄧㄢ","en":"yesterday","id":"538500001","level":"第1級"},{"zh":"自己","zhuyin":"ㄗˋ ㄐㄧˇ","en":"oneself","id":"530000049","level":"第1*級"}],"audio":"juyin:ㄗ"},{"symbol":"ㄘ","ipa":"tsʰ","how":"\"ts\" with a strong puff of air.","error":"","notes":"Written with no final, this symbol carries the empty rhyme ㄭ, which is never written. After 