ㄢˋ","en":"goodbye","id":"532400008","level":"第1級"},{"zh":"買","zhuyin":"ㄇㄞˇ","en":"to buy","id":"0582","level":"第1級"},{"zh":"愛","zhuyin":"ㄞˋ","en":"to love","id":"5762","level":"第1級"}],"audio":"juyin:ㄞ"},{"symbol":"ㄟ","ipa":"ei","how":"\"ay\".","error":"","notes":"ㄨㄟ is [wei] (pinyin -ui, which learners say as \"wee\").","examples":[{"zh":"飛機","zhuyin":"ㄈㄟ ㄐㄧ","en":"airplane","id":"082400014","level":"第1*級"},{"zh":"沒有","zhuyin":"ㄇㄟˊ ㄧㄡˇ","en":"don't have; there isn't","id":null,"level":"第1級"},{"zh":"對","zhuyin":"ㄉㄨㄟˋ","en":"right; correct","id":"1278","level":"第1級"}],"audio":"juyin:ㄟ"},{"symbol":"ㄠ","ipa":"ɑu","how":"\"ow\".","error":"","notes":"","examples":[{"zh":"老師","zhuyin":"ㄌㄠˇ ㄕ","en":"teacher","id":"179200095","level":"第1級"},{"zh":"好","zhuyin":"ㄏㄠˇ","en":"good","id":"2727","level":"第1級"},{"zh":"要","zhuyin":"ㄧㄠˋ","en":"to want","id":"6020","level":"第1級"}],"audio":"juyin:ㄠ"},{"symbol":"ㄡ","ipa":"ou","how":"\"oh\".","error":"Merging ㄡ with ㄛ.","notes":"ㄧㄡ is [jou] (pinyin -iu); the o is clearest on tones 3 and 4.","examples":[{"zh":"朋友","zhuyin":"ㄆㄥˊ ㄧㄡˇ","en":"friend","id":null,"level":"第1級"},{"zh":"手機","zhuyin":"ㄕㄡˇ ㄐㄧ","en":"mobile phone","id":null,"level":"第1級"},{"zh":"狗","zhuyin":"ㄍㄡˇ","en":"dog","id":"2259","level":"第2級"}],"audio":"juyin:ㄡ"},{"symbol":"ㄢ","ipa":"an","how":"An open \"ahn\", ending with the tongue tip on the ridge.","error":"\"ban\" [æn].","notes":"ㄧㄢ is [jɛn] (\"yen\", not \"yahn\"); ㄩㄢ is [ɥɛn] (not \"wan\").","examples":[{"zh":"吃飯","zhuyin":"ㄔ ㄈㄢˋ","en":"to eat (a meal)","id":null,"level":"第1級"},{"zh":"便當","zhuyin":"ㄅㄧㄢˋ ㄉㄤ","en":"lunch box","id":null,"level":"第3級"},{"zh":"三","zhuyin":"ㄙㄢ","en":"three","id":"5622","level":"第1級"}],"audio":"juyin:ㄢ"},{"symbol":"ㄣ","ipa":"ən","how":"Close with the tongue tip.","error":"Merging it with ㄥ.","notes":"ㄨㄣ is [wən] (pinyin -un, which learners say as \"oon\"). ㄧㄣ [in] closes with the tongue tip.","examples":[{"zh":"很","zhuyin":"ㄏㄣˇ","en":"very","id":"2780","level":"第1級"},{"zh":"人","zhuyin":"ㄖㄣˊ","e